# Share buttons — Q&A law (4444)

Every **q####** and **st####** knowledge page MUST render the enhanced share row in `pulse-machine-entry.js`.

## Required UI

- **Pulse logo** (`/pulse-favicon-adaptive.svg`) as the primary clickable share control → opens X/Twitter intent with question + URL + `@coachkorywhite`
- **LinkedIn**, **Facebook**, **email**, and **Copy link** buttons alongside
- Pre-filled share text: `{question} — Pulse Knowledge Library`
- OG/Twitter image for q/st: `/pulse-favicon-adaptive.svg`

## Do not remove or regress

- Do not drop share on q/st when editing the renderer
- Do not replace the Pulse logo X button with text-only 𝕏 on q/st pages
- Copy-link must write the canonical `/knowledge/{id}` URL

## Where it lives

`netlify/functions/pulse-machine-entry.js` — `shareHtml` block (~line 720). Requires Netlify deploy to go live.
